	<urn:solutiondesign:ontology:mechanism> "rest-api" ;
	<urn:solutiondesign:ontology:notes> "Nightly (1 AM EST) Azure Synapse pipeline batch pull from CEPI's CEDS JSON-LD API (GET /organizations), which surfaces EEM as the upstream source of record for organization records, hierarchy relationships, Lead Admin designations, grade bands, and org types. Read-only — MiEdWorkforce never writes back. sd:viaOperation deliberately omitted: sd:ApiOperation.exposedBy is domain-restricted to sd:BoundedContext (see ApiOperationShape), and CEPI/EEM is modeled as an sd:ExternalSystem, so there is no ontology-valid way to mint an ApiOperation node for CEPI's endpoint from this side — a genuine ontology expressiveness gap for BoundedContext-to-ExternalSystem REST dependencies, not a source-document gap. Per organizations-capability.md, this is intentionally the ONLY direct integration with EEM/CEPI anywhere in the mied solution design — every other domain needing organizational context depends on the Organizations capability instead, never on EEM/CEPI directly (see ext:EEMSystem's own note above on the one documented exception to this claim, from communications' own source docs)." ;
	<urn:solutiondesign:ontology:toContext> <urn:solutiondesign:instance:external:EEMSystem> .

