	<urn:solutiondesign:ontology:notes> "viaOperation deliberately omitted: documents-capability.md's Upstream Dependencies table claims credentialing supplies 'Application attachment data for document categorization' via REST API, but no documents-sequences.md diagram shows Documents calling credentialing — every sequence shows credentialing (as a calling domain) invoking Documents, the opposite direction. A genuinely undocumented integration, not a conversion gap." ;
	<urn:solutiondesign:ontology:toContext> <urn:solutiondesign:instance:credentialing:CredentialingContext> .

