<urn:solutiondesign:instance:communications:BatchJob_EmailContentArchival> a <urn:solutiondesign:ontology:BatchJob> ;
	<urn:solutiondesign:ontology:belongsToContext> <urn:solutiondesign:instance:communications:CommunicationsContext> ;
	<urn:solutiondesign:ontology:definedIn> <urn:solutiondesign:instance:communications:TechnicalDesignDoc> ;
	<urn:solutiondesign:ontology:errorHandling> "Retry failed archival operations up to 3 attempts; never delete SQL audit metadata without a successful content archival first. Alert administrators if the archival job fails, or if per-batch failure rate exceeds 5%. A post-run reconciliation query detects orphaned records where Cosmos content was deleted but the SQL content_status update didn't commit, for manual reconciliation." ;
	<urn:solutiondesign:ontology:initiatedBy> "internal-system" ;
	<urn:solutiondesign:ontology:schedule> "Daily at 2:00 AM EST — Kubernetes CronJob `0 7 * * *`, concurrency Forbid, 2-hour timeout" ;
	<urn:solutiondesign:ontology:steps> "1. Query Cosmos DB / SQL for EmailInstance rows with sent_at older than content_retention_days (default 90) and content_status = Active, batched at 1000 rows. 2. Upload full rendered content (subject, body_html, body_text) to Blob Storage cold archive, organized by year/month. 3. Delete the Cosmos DB content document. 4. Update SQL: content_status Active -> Archived/Purged, content_purged_at = now. 5. Emit EmailContentArchived (per communications-capability.md) / EmailContentPurged (per communications-sequences.md — see the domain-event-level note on the naming discrepancy between the two, and comm:BatchJob_EmailContentPurge in communications-sequences.ttl for the sequences.md-derived version of this same job). 6. After audit_retention_years (default 7), cold storage moves to Data Lake for long-term archival; Blob lifecycle: 0-90 days not yet in Blob, 90 days-2yr Cool tier, 2-7yr Archive tier, 7+yr delete after Data Lake export. Retrieval of an archived email (if ever needed): UI warns of up to 4 hours to rehydrate from Archive tier; result cached 24 hours after retrieval." ;
	<urn:solutiondesign:ontology:title> "Email Content Archival" .

<urn:solutiondesign:instance:communications:BatchJob_EmailContentPurge> a <urn:solutiondesign:ontology:BatchJob> ;
	<urn:solutiondesign:ontology:belongsToContext> <urn:solutiondesign:instance:communications:CommunicationsContext> ;
	<urn:solutiondesign:ontology:content> "sequenceDiagram\n    participant Scheduler as Kubernetes CronJob\n    participant Job as Content Purge Job\n    participant CosmosDB as Cosmos DB (Email Content)\n    participant SQL as SQL Database (Metadata)\n    participant EventBus\n    participant Monitoring\n\n    Scheduler->>Job: Trigger daily job (2:00 AM EST)\n    Job->>Job: Load configuration\n    Note over Job: content_retention_days: 90<br/>batch_size: 1000\n\n    Job->>SQL: Query instances eligible for purge\n    Note over SQL: SELECT instance_id, sent_at<br/>FROM email_instances<br/>WHERE sent_at < NOW() - 90 days<br/>AND content_status = 'Active'<br/>LIMIT 1000\n    SQL-->>Job: Batch of instance IDs\n\n    loop For each instance in batch\n        Job->>CosmosDB: DELETE email content document\n        Note over CosmosDB: Delete by instance_id<br/>(subject, body_html, body_text)\n\n        alt Delete successful\n            CosmosDB-->>Job: Success\n\n            Job->>SQL: Update instance metadata\n            Note over SQL: content_status: Active > Purged<br/>content_purged_at: timestamp\n            SQL-->>Job: Success\n\n            Job--)EventBus: EmailContentPurged {instance_id, purged_at}\n            Job->>Job: Increment success counter\n        else Delete failed\n            CosmosDB-->>Job: Error\n            Job->>Job: Log error, increment failure counter\n            Job->>Job: Add to retry queue (max 3 attempts)\n        end\n    end\n\n    Job->>Job: Calculate batch metrics\n    Note over Job: Processed: 1000<br/>Succeeded: 998<br/>Failed: 2\n\n    alt Failures exceed threshold (>5%)\n        Job->>Monitoring: Alert administrators\n        Note over Monitoring: Critical: Content purge job failing<br/>Investigate Cosmos DB connectivity\n    end\n\n    alt More instances to process\n        Job->>Job: Schedule next batch (immediate)\n    else All instances processed\n        Job->>Monitoring: Log completion metrics\n        Job-->>Scheduler: Job complete\n    end\n" ;
	<urn:solutiondesign:ontology:definedIn> <urn:solutiondesign:instance:communications:SequencesDoc> ;
	<urn:solutiondesign:ontology:errorScenarios> "Cosmos DB unavailable > retry batch, alert if persistent. SQL connection lost > job fails, retries on next schedule. Individual delete fails > retry up to 3 times, then alert. Cosmos delete succeeds but SQL update fails > manual reconciliation required (logged)." ;
	<urn:solutiondesign:ontology:eventsPublished> "EmailContentPurged - Per instance successfully purged." ;
	<urn:solutiondesign:ontology:initiatedBy> "internal-system" ;
	<urn:solutiondesign:ontology:keyDecisions> "Batch processing: 1000 instances per batch prevents memory issues. Retry logic: failed deletes retried up to 3 times. Alert threshold: >5% failure rate triggers admin alert. Two-phase delete: Cosmos DB content deleted first, then SQL metadata updated. Metadata preservation: SQL audit metadata retained indefinitely for compliance." ;
	<urn:solutiondesign:ontology:schedule> "Daily at 2:00 AM EST." ;
	<urn:solutiondesign:ontology:status> "confirmed" ;
	<urn:solutiondesign:ontology:title> "Email Content Purge Job" ;
	<urn:solutiondesign:ontology:whatWhenWho> "What: Scheduled job permanently deletes old email content while retaining audit metadata. When: Daily at 2:00 AM EST. Who: System (automated)." .

