<urn:solutiondesign:instance:epp:EPPProgramApprovalChangedEvent> a <urn:solutiondesign:ontology:DomainEvent> ;
	<urn:solutiondesign:ontology:notes> "No consumers currently, per epp-domain.md's Domain Events table — though the same table's own 'Notes' column speculates it 'may affect Pro Prep catalog availability,' which would be an internal read-model concern within epp itself, not a cross-domain subscription." ;
