<urn:solutiondesign:instance:proflearning:Fdd14Doc> a <urn:solutiondesign:ontology:SourceDocument> ;
	<urn:solutiondesign:ontology:docType> "fdd" ;
	<urn:solutiondesign:ontology:notes> "Covers Features 14.1-14.7 (document's own subtitle: '14.0 Professional Learning (14.1 - 14.7)'). Authors Caitlin Groom / Vidhya Punniyamoorthy; approved by Beth Dontje (MDE) and Caitlin Groom (CEPI), both 08/04/2025 per the signoff table — but comments.xml contains dated entries through 2026-04-06, well after that signoff date (same post-signoff-revision pattern FDD 28/29 already found in their own sibling documents), including a reviewer comment stating wireframes for these stories were STILL being gathered as of 2026-04-06. Two sibling folders hold superseded/adjacent working material not separately ingested — see this file's header note." ;
	<urn:solutiondesign:ontology:section> "functional-design-docs/14 - Professional Learning - Admin Users/14 - Professional Learning - Admin.docx" .

<urn:solutiondesign:instance:proflearning:Fdd26Doc> a <urn:solutiondesign:ontology:SourceDocument> ;
	<urn:solutiondesign:ontology:docType> "fdd" ;
	<urn:solutiondesign:ontology:notes> "Covers Features 26.1-26.6 (document's own subtitle: 'Professional Learning - Sponsor (26.1-26.6)'). Authors Liz Breckel / Caitlin Groom / Beth Dontje; approved by Beth Dontje (MDE) and Caitlin Groom (CEPI), both 08/05/2025 per the signoff table — but comments.xml contains dated entries from 2025-12-04 through 2026-03-11, six-plus months after that signoff date (the same post-signoff-revision pattern already found in FDD 28's and FDD 29's own sibling documents), including tracked-change edits as recent as 2026-03-11 that are not yet reflected in the document's own approval table. This is the ORIGINAL source FDD for plrn:Question_SponsorApprovalWorkflowContradiction (Open Question #9) — see this file's header note." ;
	<urn:solutiondesign:ontology:section> "functional-design-docs/26 - Professional Learning - Sponsor/26 - Professional Learning - Sponsor.docx" .

<urn:solutiondesign:instance:proflearning:Fdd27Doc> a <urn:solutiondesign:ontology:SourceDocument> ;
	<urn:solutiondesign:ontology:docType> "fdd" ;
	<urn:solutiondesign:ontology:notes> "Covers Features 27.1-27.3 (document's own subtitle: '27 - Professional Learning - Educator (27.1 - 27.3)'). Author Vidhya Punniyamoorthy (DTMB); approved by Beth Dontje (MDE) and Caitlin Groom (CEPI), both 08/05/2025 per the signoff table — but comments.xml/commentsExtended.xml contain dated entries from 2025-10-06 through 2026-03-11, well after that signoff date (same post-signoff-revision pattern already found in FDD 28's and FDD 29's own sibling documents in this batch)." ;
	<urn:solutiondesign:ontology:section> "functional-design-docs/27 - Professional Learning - Educator/27 - Professional Learning - Educator.docx" .

<urn:solutiondesign:instance:proflearning:Fdd28Doc> a <urn:solutiondesign:ontology:SourceDocument> ;
	<urn:solutiondesign:ontology:docType> "fdd" ;
	<urn:solutiondesign:ontology:notes> "Covers Features 28.1-28.5 (document's own subtitle: '28 - Professional Learning - Processing (28.1 - 28.5)'). Authors Vidhya Punniyamoorthy / Beth Dontje (DTMB); approved by Beth Dontje (MDE) and Caitlin Groom (CEPI), both 08/05/2025 per the signoff table — but comments.xml contains dated entries through 2026-02-02, well after that signoff date (same post-signoff-revision pattern the FDD 29 review already found in its own sibling document), meaning the document continued to be actively revised/reviewed after its nominal approval date. A companion document in the same folder, 'TBDeleted_ 28 - Professional Learning - Admin Processing.docx', is an earlier, superseded draft of the same subject matter — read and confirmed wholly superseded (see this file's header note), not separately modeled." ;
	<urn:solutiondesign:ontology:section> "functional-design-docs/28 - Professional Learning - Processing/28 - Professional Learning - Processing.docx" .

<urn:solutiondesign:instance:proflearning:Fdd31_5Doc> a <urn:solutiondesign:ontology:SourceDocument> ;
	<urn:solutiondesign:ontology:docType> "fdd" ;
	<urn:solutiondesign:ontology:notes> "Covers FDD Feature 31.5 (Public Search - Professional Learning / SCECH Sponsor & Program search). Belongs to plrn:, not credentialing, despite living in the same numbered FDD folder as 31.1-31.3." ;
	<urn:solutiondesign:ontology:section> "functional-design-docs/31 - Public Search/31.5 - Professional Learning Search.docx" .

