	<urn:solutiondesign:ontology:notes> "Not in staffing-domain.md's Domain Events table; present in the ERD's EMPLOYEE_ROSTER_EVENTS.event_type enum and emitted in the 'Update Employee Demographics' sequence, which cross-notifies the other party (citizen if district-updated, district if citizen-updated) via Communications." ;
	<urn:solutiondesign:ontology:payloadHighlights> "employeeRecordId, uniqueId, updatedFields, updateSource (DistrictUser|CitizenUser)" ;
