	<urn:solutiondesign:ontology:notes> "Confirmed by viewing: 'Positions' summary table (Position/Category/Building/Filled FTE/Unfilled FTE/Approved FTE/Status/Health/Last Update), an 'Add Position' button, filter and download icons, and dynamic search — direct visual match for 18.1.1 and the summary-page Business Specifications prose (sort/filter/search fields)." ;
