	<urn:solutiondesign:ontology:notes> "Confirmed by viewing: 'Quality Review - Certify Collection' screen with Submitting entity/Collection period end date selectors, a 'Quality review is complete. Identified 3 outstanding items' banner, paginated Errors and Warnings tables (each row: Error Description/Error Details), an attestation checkbox, and Certify/Cancel/Download Dataset actions. Directly corroborates Req_21_4_1/21_4_2/21_4_3's error-vs-warning distinction and attestation requirement." ;
	<urn:solutiondesign:ontology:section> "abox/mied-v3/fdd-review/21-roster-of-employees/wireframes/wireframe-05-quality-review-certify-collection.png" .

<urn:solutiondesign:instance:staffing:Wireframe21_6> a <urn:solutiondesign:ontology:SourceDocument> ;
