	<urn:solutiondesign:ontology:notes> "Confirmed by viewing: legacy 'MORE'-system read-only Education History table (College/University Attended, Degree, Year Completed) with two sample rows. Corroborates staff:EducationHistory's read-only-when-CEPI-sourced framing, though this specific screen shows locally-entered data, not a CEPI Data Warehouse feed distinguishably." ;
	<urn:solutiondesign:ontology:section> "abox/mied-v3/fdd-review/22-employee-assignment-details/wireframes/wireframe-01-education-history-readonly-legacy.png" .

<urn:solutiondesign:instance:staffing:Wireframe22_02> a <urn:solutiondesign:ontology:SourceDocument> ;
