	<urn:solutiondesign:ontology:docType> "wireframe" ;
	<urn:solutiondesign:ontology:notes> "Confirmed by viewing: same 'Edit Employee' screen with a 'Success! Details updated XXXX <<Unique ID>>' banner and a second history row (Status 'Approved', Authorized by 'Business'), added below the original 'Created' row. Directly corroborates the update-history-tracking half of Req_24_BizSpec_2 and staff:Seq_UpdateEmployeeDemographics's 'Store demographic update in history' step." ;
